s/1.63.x/install/quickstart/aws/ecs/#aws-cli-quickstart&#34;&gt;AWS CLI Quickstart&lt;/a&gt; or the pattern &lt;a href=&#34;https://containersonaws.com/pattern/ecs-ec2-bottlerocket-cluster&#34;&gt;Amazon ECS cluster on Bottlerocket&lt;/a&gt; which outlines how to start Bottlerocket with &lt;a href=&#34;https://docs.aws.amazon.com/serverless-application-model/&#34;&gt;SAM CLI&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
